<p part="F">
  <lb n="1" break="no"/>māsa kr̥ṣṇa-<unclear>pakṣa</unclear>
  <lb n="2"/>nav<choice><orig>ā</orig><reg>a</reg></choice>mi ha<unclear>r</unclear>yaṁ
  <lb n="3"/>pon· vr̥haspati-vā<lb n="4" break="no"/>ra</p><p>tatkāla s<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ma ri
  <lb n="5"/>maṇḍivuṅa
</p>
